{"resource":{"id":"go-best-practices","title":"Go \u2014 Best Practices","category":"Programming","difficulty":"Intermediate","readingTime":"17 min","pages":18,"lastUpdated":"March 2026","tags":["Programming","Go","Concurrency"],"heroImage":"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1461749280684-dccba630e2f6?w=1800&q=80","heroSubtitle":"A professional handbook on Go coding standards, concurrency, testing, security, performance, deployment, and production-ready engineering workflows."},"toc":[{"id":"objectives","label":"Learning Objectives"},{"id":"s1","label":"1. Coding Standards"},{"id":"s2","label":"2. Project Structure"},{"id":"s3","label":"3. Package Organization"},{"id":"s4","label":"4. Error Handling"},{"id":"s5","label":"5. Concurrency"},{"id":"s6","label":"6. Testing"},{"id":"s7","label":"7. Logging"},{"id":"s8","label":"8. Monitoring"},{"id":"s9","label":"9. Security"},{"id":"s10","label":"10. Performance"},{"id":"s11","label":"11. Deployment"},{"id":"s12","label":"12. Documentation"},{"id":"s13","label":"13. Production Checklist"},{"id":"summary","label":"Summary"},{"id":"faqs","label":"FAQ"},{"id":"glossary","label":"Glossary"},{"id":"references","label":"References"},{"id":"disclaimer","label":"Disclaimer"}],"related":[{"title":"Go \u2014 Common Mistakes","tag":"Programming","time":"13 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 Advanced Concepts","tag":"Programming","time":"25 min"},{"title":"Go \u2014 Project Guide","tag":"Programming","time":"17 min"}],"html":"<section id=\"objectives\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Learning Objectives</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Write idiomatic Go that reviewers approve on first pass.</li>\n          <li>Structure projects for growth and long-term maintainability.</li>\n          <li>Ship code that's observable, secure, and easy to operate.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s1\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">1. Coding Standards</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>gofmt / goimports on save \u2014 non-negotiable.</li>\n          <li>Short names in small scope; descriptive names in package APIs.</li>\n          <li>Accept interfaces, return concrete types.</li>\n          <li>No stutter: <code>http.Request</code>, not <code>http.HTTPRequest</code>.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s2\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">2. Project Structure</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>cmd/         # main packages (one per binary)\ninternal/    # private code\npkg/         # exportable libraries\nmigrations/\ndeploy/</code></pre></div>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1451187580459-43490279c0fa?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 1 \u2014 Standard Go project layout used across the community.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s3\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">3. Package Organization</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Package by capability, not by kind. Prefer <code>billing/</code> over <code>models/</code>, <code>controllers/</code>, <code>services/</code>.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s4\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">4. Error Handling</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Wrap with <code>%w</code>, inspect with <code>errors.Is</code> / <code>errors.As</code>. Never swallow. Distinguish expected errors from bugs.</p>\n        <div class=\"my-3 overflow-hidden rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-slate-950 text-slate-100 shadow-sm\"><div class=\"flex items-center justify-between border-b border-white/10 px-4 py-2 text-xs text-slate-400\"><span>python</span></div><pre class=\"overflow-x-auto p-4 text-[13px] leading-relaxed\"><code>if err != nil {\n    return fmt.Errorf(&quot;fetch user %s: %w&quot;, id, err)\n}</code></pre></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s5\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">5. Concurrency</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Every goroutine has a documented owner and lifetime.</li>\n          <li>Pass <code>context.Context</code> as the first parameter.</li>\n          <li>Bound fan-out with worker pools or <code>errgroup.SetLimit</code>.</li>\n          <li>Prefer channels for ownership transfer; mutexes for shared state.</li>\n        </ul>\n        <div class=\"my-4 rounded-2xl border-l-4 border-red-500/40 bg-red-500/10 text-red-900 dark:text-red-100 p-4\"><div class=\"flex items-start gap-3\"><div class=\"mt-0.5 shrink-0\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-5 w-5\"><path d=\"m21.73 18-8-14a2 2 0 0 0-3.48 0l-8 14A2 2 0 0 0 4 21h16a2 2 0 0 0 1.73-3Z\"/><path d=\"M12 9v4\"/><path d=\"M12 17h.01\"/></svg></div><div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\"><p class=\"text-sm font-semibold\">Rule</p><div class=\"mt-1 text-sm\">Don't communicate by sharing memory; share memory by communicating.</div></div></div></div>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s6\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">6. Testing</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Table-driven tests, real Postgres in Docker for integration, <code>-race</code> always in CI. Property-based tests via <code>rapid</code> for pure functions.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s7\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">7. Logging</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Structured JSON via <code>log/slog</code>. Log at boundaries \u2014 handler entry/exit, external calls. Never log secrets or PII.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s8\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">8. Monitoring</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Prometheus RED metrics, OpenTelemetry traces, health/readiness probes. Alert on SLO burn, not raw thresholds.</p>\n        <Figure src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544197150-b99a580bb7a8?w=1400&q=80\" caption=\"Figure 2 \u2014 Observability stack: metrics for trends, traces for causality, logs for context.\" />\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s9\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">9. Security</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>Input validation on every boundary.</li>\n          <li>Parameterised SQL \u2014 never string concatenation.</li>\n          <li>Secrets from vault, not env files in the repo.</li>\n          <li><code>govulncheck</code> in CI.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s10\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">10. Performance</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Profile before optimizing (<code>pprof</code>, <code>trace</code>). Reduce allocations on hot paths. Use <code>sync.Pool</code> judiciously.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s11\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">11. Deployment</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Distroless images, static binaries, health probes, graceful shutdown on SIGTERM, rolling deploys with automated rollback.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s12\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">12. Documentation</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Every exported identifier has a doc comment starting with its name. README, ARCHITECTURE.md, ADRs for major decisions.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"s13\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">13. Production Checklist</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li>\u2705 CI green with <code>-race</code>, <code>govulncheck</code>, and coverage gate.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Metrics, logs, traces wired in staging.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Graceful shutdown &amp; readiness probes.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Runbook for top 5 alerts.</li>\n          <li>\u2705 Load-tested at 2\u00d7 peak.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"summary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Summary &amp; Key Takeaways</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p>Idiomatic Go is small, boring, and observable. Consistency across the team compounds \u2014 pick standards, encode them in linters, and enforce them in CI.</p>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"faqs\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">FAQ</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Which linter?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">golangci-lint with a curated set (govet, staticcheck, errcheck, gosec, revive).</div></details>\n        <details class=\"group my-2 rounded-2xl border border-border/60 bg-card p-4 open:shadow-sm\"><summary class=\"flex cursor-pointer list-none items-center justify-between gap-4 text-sm font-semibold\"><span>Panics allowed?</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"h-4 w-4 shrink-0 transition group-open:rotate-90\"><path d=\"m9 18 6-6-6-6\"/></svg></summary><div class=\"mt-3 text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Only in <code>main</code> for unrecoverable startup errors. Never as flow control.</div></details>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"glossary\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Glossary</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <ul class=\"list-disc space-y-1 pl-5\">\n          <li><strong>ADR</strong> \u2014 Architecture Decision Record.</li>\n          <li><strong>SLO</strong> \u2014 Service Level Objective.</li>\n          <li><strong>pprof</strong> \u2014 Go's built-in profiler.</li>\n        </ul>\n      </div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"references\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">References</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\"><References /></div></section>\n\n      <section id=\"disclaimer\" class=\"scroll-mt-24 pt-10\"><h2 class=\"text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight sm:text-3xl\">Disclaimer</h2><div class=\"mt-4 space-y-4 text-foreground/90\">\n        <p class=\"text-sm text-muted-foreground\">Educational content. Adapt practices to your context and constraints. Trademarks belong to their respective owners.</p>\n      </div></section>"}